  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the rehydrated seaweed, praline french roast nuts, olive oil, lemon juice, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Spread the mixture out in a single layer on a baking sheet.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 20 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Remove the baking sheet from the oven and sprinkle with chopped parsley.",
    "Return the baking sheet to the oven and roast for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the Zero Waste Norwegian Seaweed Roast from the oven and let it cool for a few minutes.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy."
